#: lib/alnasl_web/live/setup_live.ex:696
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "For games of a few minutes or less. It changes two things: a move must stand for %{settle} ms instead of %{settle_default}, and a board put back to the position before the last move is not read as a takeback - at that speed it is a piece going to and fro. Nothing else is touched, the number of unseen moves searched for included. \"Back to the defaults\" undoes it."
msgstr ""

